"steam-3809080","kind":"announcement","title":"CDKey giveaway | 100,000 wishlists, Thank you!","summary":"Hi everyone,Never Wither just passed 100,000 wishlists on Steam!That's a big moment for our team, and we wanted to take a minute to say thanks. If you've wishlisted the game, shared it with a friend, or stopped by to see what we're making—you've helped us get here. The Never Wither demo is out now on Steam. Give it a try!We've got some artwork to celebrate. This one's for you!We're also running a game key giveaway on X as a thank-you to the community. You can find the details and enter here:http","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T11:59:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028576","verified_at":"2026-10-21T16:50:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3809080-1846651706693786","game_id":"steam-3809080","kind":"announcement","title":"Potential Workaround for Crashes in the Never Wither Demo","summary":"Dear Gardeners,We've noticed that the Never Wither Demo is experiencing higher-than-expected memory usage, which may cause the game to crash. We're currently working on fixes and optimizations to address this issue.In the meantime, you can try increasing your virtual memory to help reduce the likelihood of crashes. Please follow the steps below:How to Set Up Virtual Memory on Windows 10Right-click This PC and select Properties.Click Advanced system settings on the left.Under the Advanced tab, cl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T05:34:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693786","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3809080-1846651706690923","game_id":"steam-3809080","kind":"announcement","title":"Never Wither Demo is Now Live for Steam Next Fest","summary":"Dear Gardeners:We're delighted to announce that the Never Wither demo is now live alongside Steam Next Fest. You can download and play the Never Wither demo for free on Steam. The demo will stay open throughout Next Fest. We're giving every player who plays the Never Wither demo a small gift: decorate your home with this unique message board. Welcome to the continent of Edda!About Never WitherNever Wither is an open-world survival building action RPG centered on creature collection. You can coll","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:59:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690923","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3809080-1846651706689949","game_id":"steam-3809080","kind":"update","title":"Demo Version 0.6.19 Patch Notes","summary":"Bug FixesFixed an issue where the Gulpfrog's bag could not be displayed in some cases.Fixed an issue where the Guardian Icon could not be used in some cases.Fixed an issue where dismantling buildings could prevent the World Tree Seedling from being moved in some cases.Fixed an issue where some creatures erroneously gained certain abilities.Experience ImprovementsIncreased the Purification chance for all creatures, and removed the use function and effects of the Glowcap.Reduced the time required ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T12:12:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689949","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3809080-1846651706684113","game_id":"steam-3809080","kind":"update","title":"Demo Version 0.6.17 Patch Notes","summary":"Bug FixesFixed an issue that could cause a password error when entering a lobby.(Players who have already set a password must set a new password on the Load Game screen and load their save for the password to take effect)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T08:47:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684113","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3809080-1846651706681359","game_id":"steam-3809080","kind":"update","title":"Demo Version 0.6.16 Patch Notes","summary":"Bug FixesFixed an issue that could prevent interaction with the World Tree Seedling.Fixed an issue where the Bobtail Hunter could not use Basic Attacks due to an error.Fixed an issue where walls could not be dismantled in multiplayer.Fixed an issue where some server settings did not take effect.Fixed an issue where match history was not displayed correctly.Fixed an issue where Imprints were lost from Stasis Amber due to an error.Experience ImprovementsImproved map visibility: you can now telepor","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T12:53:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681359","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3809080-1846651706677007","game_id":"steam-3809080","kind":"update","title":"Demo Version 0.6.7 Patch Notes","summary":"Content Changes· Increased the amount of Manacite contained in a single Manacite Druse.· Fixed some known issues.(To play multiplayer, the host must update to version 0.6.7 or later.)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T09:55:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706677007","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3809080-1846651706676409","game_id":"steam-3809080","kind":"announcement","title":"Controller issue in the Never WitherDemo","summary":"Dear Gardeners,The Never Wither Demo does not support playing with a controller. Connecting a controller will prevent the game from being operated properly. If you have run into this issue, the temporary workaround is as follows:Disable Steam Input for the Never Wither Demo: In your Steam Library, right-click the game → Properties → Controller → Never Wither Demo Override → Disable Steam Input.Thank you all for playing the demo!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T05:28:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706676409","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3809080-1846651706676077","game_id":"steam-3809080","kind":"announcement","title":"Never Wither Press Preview Demo is Now Live (Players Can Also Play Now)","summary":"Greetings! Never Wither opened its Next Fest press preview demo on October 15. During this period, all players can also play the Never Wither demo early. You can read the Demo FAQ here: Already took part in the earlier stest and want something new? We recommend trying the newly opened multiplayer mode! You can cooperate or compete with your friends, which brings a whole new experience. The demo supports English, Simplified Chinese, and Traditional Chinese, and multiplayer is now available. The d","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T02:00:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706676077","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3809080-1846651706672911","game_id":"steam-3809080","kind":"announcement","title":"Never Wither Demo is Coming Soon | Frequently Asked Questions","summary":"Greetings! Never Wither is about to open its playtest during Steam Next Fest. We'll answer some of the most frequently asked questions here, and we hope it helps you explore the continent of Edda more smoothly!Q: How do I get the demo?A: The demo is open to all players. Just head to the store page to download and play it. Q: What content can I play in the demo?A: You can explore the game's first region, \"Verdant Valley,\" in single-player or multiplayer mode. It's home to 19 creatures and 4 bosse","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T02:00:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706672911","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3809080-1844115010502848","game_id":"steam-3809080","kind":"announcement","title":"Never Wither Joins the 2026 Multiplayer Games Fest","summary":"Greetings to all Gardeners, Adventurers, Guardians of the World Tree, and Temple Builders... Long time no see!We're Geo Seed Games, and we're honored to bring Never Wither to the 2026 Multiplayer Games Fest.Beyond its single-player mode, Never Wither has plenty to offer for those who want to play together. After launch, we plan to support two forms of multiplayer: P2P connections and dedicated servers. The former suited to small-scale private adventures, the latter able to host far more players.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T01:18:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010502848","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3809080-1843481262703410","game_id":"steam-3809080","kind":"announcement","title":"Never Wither Demo Set to Launch at October 2026 | Community Spotlight #5","summary":"Welcome to Community Spotlight! Here, we'll regularly share community discussions, creative highlights, and the latest updates from the dev team.First, in case you missed the biggest news: Never Wither is bringing its demo to Steam Next Fest this October. Feel free to download and play the demo on October 20.After the demo news went live, we were honored to receive coverage from many media friends and content creators. Thanks to Gamer Headlines, Indie Games Hub, Bahamut, APP Bank, Chuapp, Reddit","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T02:24:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262703410","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3809080-1842212951302512","game_id":"steam-3809080","kind":"announcement","title":"Never Wither Demo Coming to the October Steam Next Fest","summary":"Dear Gardeners:We're excited to announce that Never Wither will bring its demo to the Steam Next Fest in October. You'll be able to download and play the Never Wither demo on October 20. This demo is open to all players and supports online multiplayer. It's the perfect chance for you and your friends to explore Edda. In this demo, you'll be able to play through the first region of Never Wither — Verdant Valley — which will feel familiar to any Gardener who took part in our first small-scale test","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T09:00:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951302512","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3809080-1842212951301773","game_id":"steam-3809080","kind":"announcement","title":"Never Wither: New Gameplay Trailer Released | Demo Coming to October Next Fest","summary":"Welcome to the brand-new gameplay trailer for Never Wither! Awaken among ancient ruins, journey across river valleys, plateaus, and snowy mountains, and build your own Temple, gather creature companions, and challenge the toughest of enemies. Survive, and purify the entire continent!During this time, we've been steadily adding more content to Edda. You can see the iconic outposts and ancient Temples of Windhowl Plateau, as well as several distinctly different races living there. Volcanic craters","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T02:00:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951301773","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3809080-1839676055886898","game_id":"steam-3809080","kind":"announcement","title":"Never Wither Participates in ChinaJoy 2026 Steam Showcase","summary":"Greetings! Adventurers, Gardeners, Guardians of the World Tree, Temple builders... it's been a while! This is Geo Seed Games, and we're honored to bring Never Wither to the ChinaJoy 2026 Steam event. Be sure to add Never Wither to your wishlist!If this is your first time hearing about Never Wither: it's an open-world survival crafting ARPG with creature collection at its core. Here, you'll embark on a journey to gather creature companions, build a thriving home, and purify the entire world. You ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-31T02:12:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055886898","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3809080-1839676055884644","game_id":"steam-3809080","kind":"announcement","title":"Name Me! The Results Are In","summary":"After a week of voting, our creature naming event has officially wrapped. Thank you to everyone who submitted a name and everyone who voted. Now, let's take a look at the results.Creature AFinal name: Tremorspike——named by ApolloInspiration: \"Tremorspike\" combines Tremor (the shaking earth) and Spike (the thorns lining its back). You never see it coming — you feel it. The ground quakes, thorns split the snow, and by the time you realize it's there, it has already struck from below and vanished u","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-30T09:00:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055884644","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3809080-1839041357025483","game_id":"steam-3809080","kind":"announcement","title":"Name Me! Creature Naming Vote Is Now Open","summary":"Thank you to every gardener who sent in a name!The dev team went through multiple rounds of discussion, weighing world-fit, memorability, and accuracy in capturing each creature before settling on the shortlists below. Names that didn't make the cut have their own merits too — we've taken note of them all. Who knows, you might run into them again in Edda someday. Which name will be in the game? Now it's your time to decide.Vote on X:Creature A VoteCreature B VoteVoting closes July 29. The winnin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-23T02:07:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357025483","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3809080-1836506165582752","game_id":"steam-3809080","kind":"announcement","title":"Journey to Where the Wind Howls | Never Wither Dev Log #4","summary":"Greetings!It's been a while since the first round of playtesting concluded. We've been sorting through your feedback while continuing to push forward with the development of new areas and content. In the previous dev log, we focused on the playable content in the Verdant Valley test build. This time, we'd like to turn our lens away from the river valley and take you higher — let's check out the development progress on the plateau region.Starting from the beginning, taking one step forward.Windho","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-09T09:00:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165582752","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3809080-1836506165575888","game_id":"steam-3809080","kind":"announcement","title":"Name Me — Never Wither Creature Naming Contest Now Live!","summary":"Greetings, Gardeners!Two new companions have arrived on the continent of Edda, and they don't have names yet. This time, we want you to name them. The name you come up with could be officially written into the game and appear on the screens of players worldwide. Submit your names now via the questionnaire: https://forms.gle/UCWsmp8sTXEAK9h3ACreatures to Be Named This Round【Creature A】Born deep within the mines of Edda, its back is covered with massive spines, and it bears a drill-like structure ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-06T12:30:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165575888","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3809080-1833968530899207","game_id":"steam-3809080","kind":"announcement","title":"Never Wither First Playtest Concluded! Welcome to give feedback","summary":"Greetings！The first playtest of Never Wither has officially ended. Thank you so much for your participation. As developers, when the world we built with our own hands finally welcomes its first explorers, it's hard to put into words just how excited and thrilled we are. Now, please continue to share your thoughts on Never Wither — fill out the questionnaire and send your voice directly to the developers:https://forms.gle/ouhb7p18TDr2Gz7M8Over the three days of testing, players left their footpri","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-02T02:00:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530899207","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3809080-1833968530896383","game_id":"steam-3809080","kind":"announcement","title":"Controller Crash Issue in Never Wither Playtest","summary":"Hello Gardeners,We have confirmed earlier that connecting a controller causes the Never Wither Playtest to crash on startup. Below are temporary workarounds:Disable Steam Input for Never Wither Playtest: Right-click the game in your Steam Library → Properties → Controller → Override for Never Wither Playtest → Disable Steam Input.Thank you for your assistance in testing!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-01T03:32:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530896383","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3809080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:46:18Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:46:18Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3809080":"2026-10-26T00:46:18Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3809080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:46:18Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:46:18Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"3825370":{"last_attempt_